AxisOS Software Manager (X-App Architecture)
============================================
Developed in Python 3 & GTK 3 following the Linux Mint X-Apps Design Philosophy.
Features:
- Traditional desktop layout: Classic MenuBar, Dedicated ToolBar, Main View, StatusBar
- Multi-source backend: Debian Bookworm APT (libapt-pkg), Flathub Flatpak, .axis native
- Desktop agnostic: Operates seamlessly on Cinnamon, MATE, and Xfce
- Functionality-first: Direct access to local package installation, mirror management, and sources
"""

